            "title": "Blue Pure 311i Max <br> Great value",
            "title_style": "h4",
            "richtext": "<p>Great value option with high smoke CADR 250 cfm so it quickly cleans a medium-large room 387 ft² in 12.5 minutes and up to 928 ft² in 30 minutes.<\/p><p>Simpler interface with just two-button control to turn on\/off, adjust speed and brightness level.<\/p>",
