            "title": "SmokeBlock Filters <br> Available for select Blue models",
            "title_style": "h4",
            "richtext": "<p>SmokeBlock filters have additional activated carbon to remove 99.9% of wildfire emissions for extra protection against smoke, toxic gasses, smog and odors.<\/p><p>We recommend replacing your air purifier filter about every 6 months when used 24 hours a day.<\/p>",
